# Acme Support Guide

## Company Overview

Acme provides cloud-based software solutions for small and medium-sized businesses. Our platform helps companies manage customers, support requests, and internal operations.

## Support Hours

Our customer support team is available Monday through Friday, from 09:00 to 18:00 UTC.

Support requests submitted outside these hours are processed on the next business day.

## Account Management

Customers can update their account information from the Account Settings page.

To change an account email address, the user must contact customer support.

## Password Reset

If a customer forgets their password, they can use the "Forgot Password" option on the login page.

A password reset link is sent to the registered email address. The link is valid for 30 minutes.

## Refund Policy

Customers can request a refund within 14 days of purchase.

Refund requests must include the order number and the reason for the request.

## Contact

For additional assistance, customers can contact the support team through the support portal.
